      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To synthesize plain text to an audio byte stream, I will use the Amazon Polly service, which is a cloud-based text-to-speech service. I will import the necessary module from the AWS SDK (Boto3) and use the Amazon Polly client to synthesize the text. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the Boto3 module and the use of the Amazon Polly client. </thinking>\n",
